# Normalize line endings: store as LF in the repo, check out native per OS.
* text=auto

# Explicit text types. Go sources are always checked out with LF: gofmt treats
# CRLF as a formatting difference, which broke the Windows CI job when the
# runner's autocrlf converted them.
*.go      text eol=lf
go.mod    text eol=lf
go.sum    text eol=lf
*.ts      text
*.vue     text
*.js      text
*.json    text
*.md      text
*.css     text
*.html    text
*.rules   text

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
